{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blackjack pulls you into the thrill of the gamble\u2014every card flip is a rush, every decision a test of nerve. Feel the tension rise as you chase 21, balancing risk and reward in a game where one move can mean triumph or defeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/54f8bab0fdd381684a6fd6146f85fb70.gif?t=1744882820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Blackjack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blackjack is a game of pure tension and excitement, where every card drawn keeps you on the edge of your seat. Will you play it safe or risk it all? Each round is a battle of luck and strategy, where fortunes can change in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/extras/509bcf764072f45da3ecc62a59ff45ff.gif?t=1744882820\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The thrill builds as you push your luck, feeling the rush of a perfect hand or the heartbreak of going bust. Every decision matters, every moment counts\u2014it's a test of nerve, instinct, and sheer adrenaline-fueled fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590830?t=1744882820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590830?t=1744882820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/0ce5882eaba67bfc18b36f003aa6b5a1dedc1449/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744882820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590830/0ce5882eaba67bfc18b36f003aa6b5a1dedc1449/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744882820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript